#org @gText_ssanne_sailor1postbattle
My pa said there are 100 kinds of\nPok\emon. I think there are more.

#org @gText_ssanne_sailor1cantbattle
Hmm[.]\nYou're going to need more\lPok\emon to battle us.

#org @gText_ssanne_sailor2PreBattle
Hey, matey!\pLet's do a little jig!

#org @gText_ssanne_sailor2Lose
You're impressive!

#org @gText_ssanne_sailor2postbattle
How many kinds of Pok\emon do you\nthink there are in this big world?

#org @gText_ssanne_PreBattle
I collected these Pok\emon\nfrom all around the world!

#org @gText_ssanne_trainer1_lose
Oh, no!\nI went around the world for these!

#org @gText_ssanne_trainer1_postbattle
You hurt my poor Pok\emon!\pI demand that you heal them at a\nPok\emon Center!

#org @gText_ssanne_trainer2_prebattle
Competing against the young keeps\nme youthful.

#org @gText_ssanne_trainer2_lose
Good match!\nAh, I feel young again!

#org @gText_ssanne_trainer2_postbattle
Fifteen years ago, I would\nhave won!

